  "img": "modules/titan-vttrpg-compendium/icons/paths/WhiteFox_Path_Icon.webp",
  "description": "<p>You create<strong> i</strong>llusory copies of yourself, making it more difficult for creatures to target you.</p><p>For <strong>1 minute</strong>, you gain <strong>4</strong> illusory copies.</p><p>When an enemy hits you with an attack or targets you with a spell, roll 1dX where X is 1 + the number of copies you have remaining.</p><p>On a roll of <strong>1</strong>, the attack hits or the spell goes through. On any other roll, one of your copies is destroyed instead.</p><p>If you use this ability again before all the copies are destroyed, you have <strong>4</strong> copies again.</p>",
